 "intro_zh": "颐和园主景区由万寿山、昆明湖组成，全园占地3.009平方公里，水面约占四分之三。园内现存各式宫殿、园林古建7万平方米，并以珍贵的文物藏品闻名于世，是第一批全国重点文物保护单位。1988年，颐和园被联合国教科文组织列入《世界遗产名录》。",
 "intro_en": "The main scenic area of ​​the Summer Palace consists of Wanshou Mountain and Kunming Lake. The entire garden covers an area of ​​3.009 square kilometers, and the water surface accounts for about three-quarters. There are 70,000 square meters of various palaces and ancient gardens in the park, and it is world-famous for its precious collection of cultural relics. It is one of the first batch of national key cultural relics protection units. In 1988, the Summer Palace was included in the World Heritage List by UNESCO.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
